 ```
 
+`createPatch(from, to)` produces a localized RFC 6902 patch that transforms one JSON value into
+another. It does not mutate either input; unchanged object members and array ranges are omitted.
+
+```ts
+createPatch(
+  { service: { port: 8080, debug: false } },
+  { service: { port: 8081, debug: false } },
+); // [{ op: 'replace', path: '/service/port', value: 8081 }]
+```
+
 ## JSON Merge Patch
 
 `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
